# Always publish live

After finishing game or hub changes in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant files (with the usual git safety rules).
2. **Push to `origin` immediately** so GitHub Pages updates — do not wait to be asked.
3. Only skip the push if the user explicitly says not to publish / push / go live.

Bump `WORDLE_BUILD` / `?v=` cache-bust when shipping frontend changes, as usual.
